{"version":1,"content":"<p>「樂壇小天后」炎明熹（Gigi）、陳柏宇及劉浩龍等前晚於中文大學演出校園騷，期間Gigi與劉浩龍一起擔任主持，劉浩龍更為殺入叱咤「我最喜愛的女歌手」5強的Gigi拉票，Gigi怕醜致謝，全場歡呼聲不斷，甚受歡迎！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.360956+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T16:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_hash":"0f1e4e93496aa6483f0bb7466e7c000481c2a639a001a9b60c80c8facba77403","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}